sec.p:
TDP‐43_SAA was positive in 6 out of 14 CSF (43%) from C9orf72 (2 out of 8 presymptomatic) and GRN (4 out of 6 presymptomatic) carriers. The age at CSF collection did not significantly differ between TDP‐43_SAA+ and TDP‐43_SAA− presymptomatc carriers (p > 0.05). Remarkably, although not statistically significant, we have found that the fluorescence intensities reached by these samples were lower than those observed in symptomatic patients (Figure 
1C
).
